<%# What the session drawer shows between a card's click and the detail body
    arriving, so the panel slides in on the shape of a session rather than on an
    empty grey sheet.

    It is not rendered into the frame directly: the dashboard carries it once in a
    <template>, and session-drawer#open clones it into the frame each time it starts
    loading a different session (see that controller). A frame that starts out
    holding it would show it under a drawer that is closed.

    Shaped like _detail's drawer header — the close / expand controls, a title,
    the status row, the metadata line — then the status panel and the two
    disclosures the body opens on, so the swap to the real body does not jump.

    The close button is live: it carries data-session-drawer-close, which the
    drawer handles by delegation, so a reader who clicked the wrong card can
    dismiss the drawer before the body arrives — data-drawer-skeleton exempts it
    from the dim-and-inert style a busy session_detail frame otherwise gets
    (app/assets/tailwind/application.css). Carries no id and no
    data-live-region, for the reason _provenance_skeleton gives.

    The composer at the bottom is not a placeholder: it takes typing from the
    first frame (_drawer_composer). It sits outside the role="status" region,
    which is only the part that is loading. %>
<div data-drawer-skeleton>
<div role="status" aria-busy="true" aria-label="Loading session">
  <span class="sr-only">Loading session…</span>

  <div class="bg-white shadow">
    <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <button type="button" data-session-drawer-close title="Close" aria-label="Close session details" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100 rounded-md">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <span class="h-6 w-px bg-gray-200" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="h-5 w-5 rounded bg-gray-200 animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="animate-pulse space-y-3" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="h-7 w-2/3 rounded bg-gray-200"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="h-6 w-24 rounded-full bg-gray-200"></div>
          <div class="h-4 w-32 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
          <div class="h-3 w-28 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
          <div class="h-3 w-36 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
          <div class="h-3 w-24 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
          <div class="h-3 w-40 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-2 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4 sm:py-8 animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="bg-white shadow rounded-lg divide-y divide-gray-200">
      <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 space-y-2">
        <div class="h-3.5 w-40 rounded bg-gray-200"></div>
        <div class="h-3 w-3/4 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
        <div class="h-3 w-1/2 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
      </div>
      <% [ "w-32", "w-28", "w-24" ].each do |width| %>
        <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="h-4 w-4 rounded bg-gray-200 flex-shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="h-3.5 <%= width %> rounded bg-gray-200"></div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%= render "sessions/drawer_composer" %>
</div>
